ined progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 07 21 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fibroadipose tissue with white glistening nodular parenchyma  Specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes A and B  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  NO GROSS EVIDENCE OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  EXCISION   report_end  , No.
